for the story are lying.

00:00:44.589 --> 00:00:45.749
So hold on.

00:00:45.749 --> 00:00:50.590
Are they real and lying or they don't exist
and are made up by the media outlets?

00:00:50.590 --> 00:00:52.620
All four media outlets, which is it?

00:00:52.620 --> 00:00:53.890
And this is amazing.

00:00:53.890 --> 00:00:56.510
And Trump barely able to speak.

00:00:56.510 --> 00:00:59.799
You will hear him say here three and a half
years.

00:00:59.799 --> 00:01:00.940
It just makes no sense.

00:01:00.940 --> 00:01:02.620
He's making no sense.

00:01:02.620 --> 00:01:07.289
I've gone after me more than any president
in the United States in history, in the history

00:01:07.289 --> 00:01:09.090
of the United States.

00:01:09.090 --> 00:01:10.090
And it's a shame.

00:01:10.090 --> 00:01:11.090
It's a shame.

00:01:11.090 --> 00:01:16.210
And despite that, we've done more in the first
three and a half years than any administration.

00:01:16.210 --> 00:01:19.270
There's been no administration that's done
more when you add it all up.

00:01:19.270 --> 00:01:24.990
There's been no despite all of the horrible
