able to do what I've done.

00:01:31.159 --> 00:01:37.009
And that includes the Great Mission Act, because
what Obama passed was a joke.

00:01:37.009 --> 00:01:38.920
It was a joke.

00:01:38.920 --> 00:01:42.079
