possible.

00:01:42.079 --> 00:01:43.810
And that includes accountability.

00:01:43.810 --> 00:01:50.070
So it's a disgrace that somebody is allowed
to write things like that.

00:01:50.070 --> 00:01:51.070
It could have been.

00:01:51.070 --> 00:01:55.049
A lot of times the sources aren't sources
