00:02:05.369 --> 00:02:07.960
There are fake sources made up by the media
outlets.

00:02:07.960 --> 00:02:08.960
All for.

00:02:08.960 --> 00:02:12.860
Or is it that these are disgruntled former
employees who are lying?

00:02:12.860 --> 00:02:14.750
The grief, the briefing didn't get any better.

